{"slug":"13-1-fooldal","lang":"en","no":"13.1","title":"Home page","module":"CRM","module_no":"13","updated":"2026.08.26","version":"v2026.08.26","url":"https://help.infinityhu.eu/en/13-1-fooldal.html","sections":[],"html":"<p>After signing in, three CRM-related tabs appear on the home page:</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://help.infinityhu.eu/media/img_b6f9dd99c300.png\" class=\"shot\" loading=\"lazy\"/></p>\n<ul>\n<li><p>Projects tab: the projects in which you are a participant or a task owner</p></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://help.infinityhu.eu/media/img_3807b2d9370d.png\" class=\"shot\" loading=\"lazy\"/></p>\n<ul>\n<li><p><img src=\"https://help.infinityhu.eu/media/img_4776fab063f5.png\" class=\"shot\" loading=\"lazy\"/><img src=\"https://help.infinityhu.eu/media/img_4deebafad2bf.png\" />CRM tab: performance indicators, My contacts widget, My opportunities widget, My leads widget</p></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://help.infinityhu.eu/media/img_2a3cf0ccccff.png\" class=\"shot\" loading=\"lazy\"/></p>\n<ul>\n<li><p>Project management tab: visible only if a project of the “project management” type has been recorded</p></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://help.infinityhu.eu/media/img_fa3d6fe37bf2.png\" class=\"shot\" loading=\"lazy\"/></p>"}